Package: vetviona
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dylan Moore (KoshkiKode LLC) <support@koshkikode.com>
Homepage: https://vetviona.koshkikode.com
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0, libsecret-1-0, libblkid1, liblzma5, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager, avahi-daemon, bluez
Description: Vetviona - private, local-first genealogy app
 Vetviona is a private, offline-first family tree builder and research
 workspace with GEDCOM import/export and RootLoop device-to-device sync.
 Your tree stays on your own devices.
